OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in fatal single-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s has died in a
OL,7,Fsingle-vehicle crash in Surrey.
OL,9,FSurrey Police said it was called to the
OL,10,Fcrash on the southbound road of the
OL,11,FA331 in Tongham, near Ash, shortly
OL,12,Fafter 12:20 BST on Friday.
OL,14,FThe driver died at the scene, the force
OL,15,Fadded.
OL,17,FPolice are appealing for anyone who was
OL,18,Fin the area between 12:15 and 12:25,
OL,19,Fwho witnessed the crash, or may have
OL,20,FCCTV, dashcam, or helmet cam footage
OL,21,Fthat could have captured all or part of
OL,22,Fit, to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
